00:018:27.000 --> 00:018:33.000
But the happiness is a internal feeling that only God controls, nobody else.

00:018:33.000 --> 00:018:36.000
And there is false happiness that does not last.

00:018:36.000 --> 00:018:38.000
And there is real happiness that lasts.

00:018:38.000 --> 00:018:42.000
So, you benefit from the credits here in this world.

00:018:42.000 --> 00:018:45.000
And this is a big mistake that most people out there make.

00:018:45.000 --> 00:018:50.000
They think that they have to wait until the Day of Judgment to cash in their credits.

00:018:52.000 --> 00:018:54.000
You start cashing it right now.

00:018:54.000 --> 00:019:02.000
So, every morning, we have to ask ourselves how many credits do I want?

00:019:03.000 --> 00:019:08.000
The Five daily Prayers are the credits that you collect daily in your record.

00:019:09.000 --> 00:019:13.000
So, we really have to consciously ask is our

00:019:13.000 --> 00:019:16.000
record going to be empty of credits or full?

00:019:16.000 --> 00:019:21.000
Because that will decide your position for eternity.

00:019:21.000 --> 00:019:25.000
Proclaim that it is a great event,

00:019:25.000 --> 00:019:30.000
a momentous event that you, the people, are disregarding.

00:019:30.000 --> 00:019:32.000
You are totally unaware of it.

00:019:32.000 --> 00:019:34.000
Aqem Al-Salat

00:019:34.000 --> 00:019:37.000
Allahu Akbar Allahu Akbar La Elaha Ella Allah

